=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Hope you are doing well</span></b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Its regarding an Urgent role, kindly let me know your Response.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Here is the Job description -<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;color:#1F497D'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=xmsonormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:12.0pt'><b><u><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Job Description</span></u></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'>Position – Azure Architect (Microsoft Fabric)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'>Location – Newark, NJ -</span></b><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> Hybrid<span style='background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'>Fulltime<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=wordsection1 style='mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Client – Capgemini<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Required Skills<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>We are seeking a highly skilled Azure Architect with hands on experience in Microsoft Fabric PB to lead cloud architecture and data platform initiatives.<br>Design and implement scalable secure and high-performance Azure solutions Hands on Architect end-to-end data platforms using Microsoft Fabric including Data Factory Synapse and Power BI.<br>Collaborate with cross functional teams to define cloud strategies and data integration patterns<br>Ensure best practices in cloud governance security and cost optimization<br>Lead migration and modernization efforts from on-prem to Azure<br>Provide technical leadership and mentorship to development teams<br>Stay updated with Azure and Fabric advancements to drive innovation<br>Strong understanding of DevOps CICD and Infrastructure as Code IaC is a plus<br>Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=wordsection1><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Thanks &amp; Regards:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;color:black'>Sachin Dixit<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;color:black'>Direct Number&nbsp;: 6098578287<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=wordsection1 style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;color:black'>Email: <a href=\"mailto:sachin.dixit@nityo.com\">sachin.dixit@nityo.com</a> &nbsp;</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;color:black'><o:p