    "text": "Hi ,\n\n \n\n \n\nHope you are doing well, \n\n \n\nIts regarding an Urgent role, kindly let me know your Response.\n\nHere is the Job description -\n\n \n\nJob Description\n\nPosition – Azure Architect (Microsoft Fabric)\n\nLocation – Newark, NJ - Hybrid\n\nFulltime\n\nClient – Capgemini\n\nRequired Skills\n\nWe are seeking a highly skilled Azure Architect with hands on experience in Microsoft Fabric PB to lead cloud architecture and data platform initiatives.\nDesign and implement scalable secure and high-performance Azure solutions Hands on Architect end-to-end data platforms using Microsoft Fabric including Data Factory Synapse and Power BI.\nCollaborate with cross functional teams to define cloud strategies and data integration patterns\nEnsure best practices in cloud governance security and cost optimization\nLead migration and modernization efforts from on-prem to Azure\nProvide technical leadership and mentorship to development teams\nStay updated with Azure and Fabric advancements to drive innovation\nStrong understanding of DevOps CICD and Infrastructure as Code IaC is a plus\nExcellent communication and stakeholder management skills.\n\n \n\nThanks & Regards:\n\nSachin Dixit\n\nDirect Number : 6098578287\n\nEmail: sachin.dixit@nityo.com <mailto:sachin.dixit@nityo.com>   \n\n <http://www.nityo.com> www.nityo.com \n\n666 Plainsboro Road, Suite 1285, Plainsboro, NJ 08536| USA\n\n",
